# Caption
Romantic Bollywood cinematic ballad, solo male vocal only, warm emotional baritone, intimate and soulful delivery, 82 BPM, dreamy piano, acoustic guitar, soft strings, subtle tabla, atmospheric pads, cinematic percussion, gradual emotional build, heartfelt vocal expressions, lush reverb, modern Bollywood production, passionate final chorus. No female vocals, no duet

# Lyric
[Intro]

Hmmm…
Teri aankhon mein jo dekha,
Woh kahaani ban gaya…
Tu jo mila mujhe,
Jaise jahaan mera mil gaya…

[Verse 1]

Khamosh raaton mein, tera naam loon,
Teri hi baaton mein, subah shaam hoon,
Jo tu muskuraaye, toh dil yeh kahe,
Tere bina ab kahin aur na rahe…

Teri saanson ki khushboo,
Meri dhadkan mein basi,
Tu jo paas ho mere,
Toh har kami lage hasi…

[Pre-Chorus]

Dheere dheere dil mera,
Tera hone laga,
Jo tha mera kal tak,
Woh tera hone laga…

[Chorus]

Tere saath, jeena hai mujhe,
Tere saath, har pal hai khubsurat,
Tu jo mile, toh mil jaaye jahaan,
Tu hi meri subah, tu hi meri shaam…

Tere saath, chalna hai mujhe,
Chahe raaste ho kitne bhi anjaan,
Haath tera, haath mein rahe,
Bas itni si hai meri daastaan…

[Verse 2]

Bheegi si baarish, tera mera safar,
Ek chhoti si chhat, aur bheegi nazar,
Tu kuch na kahe, main samajh loon tujhe,
Teri khamoshi bhi mohabbat lage…

Tere kandhe pe sar rakh kar,
Waqt ko rok loon zara,
Jo pal tere sang guzre,
Unko bana loon main dua…

[Pre-Chorus]

Dheere dheere dil mera,
Tujh mein khone laga,
Teri har ek aadat se,
Pyaar hone laga…

[Chorus]

Tere saath, jeena hai mujhe,
Tere saath, har pal hai khubsurat,
Tu jo mile, toh mil jaaye jahaan,
Tu hi meri subah, tu hi meri shaam…

[Bridge]

Agar kal badal jaaye,
Agar duniya chhoot jaaye,
Tera haath mere haath mein ho,
Toh dil phir bhi muskuraaye…

Na chaahun main daulat,
Na chaahun koi aasman,
Tu rahe mere paas,
Toh tu hi mera jahaan…

[Final Chorus]

Tere saath, jeena hai mujhe,
Tere saath, har janam hai khubsurat,
Tu jo mile, toh mil jaaye jahaan,
Tu hi meri dua, tu hi mera armaan…

Tere saath, dhalna hai mujhe,
Tere saath hi guzre har shaam,
Aakhri saans tak bas tu rahe,
Aur tera naam… mere naam ke saath…

[Outro]

Hmmm…
Tu jo mila…
Toh sab mil gaya…
Tere saath…
Mera jahaan…
<|im_end|>
