# Languages
unknown

# Lyric
[Intro]

Hmm.
Tere baad bhi, tera intezaar hai.
Jaane kyun dil ko,
Aaj bhi tujhse pyaar hai.

[Verse 1]

Raaton mein teri baatein,
Chupke se aa jaati hain,
Aankhon ke in raaston se,
Yaadein beh jaati hain.

Jo khwaab tere sang dekhe,
Woh aaj bhi zinda hain,
Tu paas nahi hai mere,
Phir bhi tu mere andar hai.

[Pre-Chorus]

Main khud se poochhta hoon,
Kyun tujhko bhool na paaya,
Dil ne har baar mujhe,
Tera hi raasta dikhaya.

[Chorus]

Tum bin, main adhoora sa hoon,
Tum bin, jaise khud se juda hoon,
Tu chhod gaya jo haath mera,
Main aaj bhi wahin khada hoon.

Tum bin, ye dil nahi lagta,
Tum bin, kuch bhi nahi sajta,
Tu laut ke aaye na aaye,
Dil tera intezaar karta.

[Verse 2]

Teri galiyon se guzrun,
Toh kadam ruk jaate hain,
Tere diye hue khat,
Aaj bhi muskuraate hain.

Ek tasveer teri hai,
Jo dil se mita nahi paaya,
Hazaar baar khud ko samjhaya,
Par tujhko bhula nahi paaya.

[Pre-Chorus]

Kuch baatein adhuri reh gayi,
Kuch vaade toot gaye,
Hum saath toh the kabhi,
Phir kyun itne door ho gaye.

[Chorus]

Tum bin, main adhoora sa hoon,
Tum bin, jaise khud se juda hoon,
Tu chhod gaya jo haath mera,
Main aaj bhi wahin khada hoon.

Tum bin, ye dil nahi lagta,
Tum bin, kuch bhi nahi sajta,
Tu laut ke aaye na aaye,
Dil tera intezaar karta.

[Bridge]

Agar kabhi meri yaad aaye,
Toh laut aana.
Jo keh na sake hum dono,
Woh keh jaana.

Main shikayat nahi karunga,
Na koi sawaal karunga,
Bas ek baar gale lag jaana,
Phir tujhe jaane nahi dunga.

[Final Chorus]

Tum bin, saansein toh chalti hain,
Par zindagi nahi chalti.
Tere bina ye aankhein meri,
Khushiyon se nahi milti.

Tum bin, main adhoora sa hoon,
Tum bin, jaise khud se juda hoon.
Aakhri saans tak dil kahe,
Main tera tha, aur tera hi rahunga.

[Outro]

Hmm.
Tere baad bhi, tera intezaar hai.
Jaane kyun dil ko, aaj bhi tujhse pyaar hai.<|endoftext|>
